insert into public.quick_reference_sections (id,body,version)
values ('beta-blocker-infusion','| Medication | Adult IV infusion · titration · pertinent details |
|---|---|
| **Esmolol (Brevibloc)** | **Gradual control/SVT:** optional **500 mcg/kg over 1 min**, then **50 mcg/kg/min for 4 min**. If needed, optional repeat loading doses with steps to **100**, then **150 mcg/kg/min**, each for **4 min**; increase to **200 mcg/kg/min** if needed. **HR control: maintenance >200 mcg/kg/min not recommended.** Perioperative **hypertension** may require **250–300 mcg/kg/min**; >300 not studied. Avoid close-proximity **IV verapamil**; contraindicated in pulmonary hypertension, decompensated HF, shock, severe sinus bradycardia, sick sinus syndrome and greater-than-first-degree block. ([FDA label](https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2023/019386s053lbl.pdf)) |
| **Labetalol** | **Severe hypertension:** label infusion **2 mg/min**, adjusted to BP response; usual effective total **50–200 mg**, up to **300 mg**. This is a BP-control regimen, not a standard AF rate-control infusion. Keep supine; assess orthostatic tolerance before ambulation. Avoid asthma, severe bradycardia/block, overt HF and cardiogenic shock. ([Label](https://labeling.pfizer.com/ShowLabeling.aspx?id=4492)) |
| **Landiolol (Rapiblyk)** | **Adult SVT, including AF/flutter:** normal cardiac function, start **9 mcg/kg/min**, increase **9 mcg/kg/min every 10 min**. Impaired cardiac function, start **1 mcg/kg/min**, increase **1 mcg/kg/min every 15 min**. **Maximum 36 mcg/kg/min** for either regimen. **Continuous infusion; no bolus in the US label.** Limited data beyond 24 h; half-life approximately **4 min**. Contraindicated in pulmonary hypertension, decompensated HF, shock, severe sinus bradycardia, sick sinus syndrome and greater-than-first-degree block. ([US prescribing information](https://www.rapiblyk.com/fileadmin/user_upload/MediaLibrary_Rapiblyk/Documents/Rapiblyk_Full_Prescribing_Information.pdf)) |','2026-09-27')
on conflict (id) do update set body=excluded.body,version=excluded.version,updated_at=now();

