repeated','beta-blocker','this','chart','anticoagulation','airway','rate-slowing','drugs','can','increase','beta-1','selectivity','eliminate','nonselective','contraindicated','evaluate','any','therapy','new','start','established','stable','perioperatively','appropriate','elective','initiate','optimally','days','surgery','assess','tolerance','titrate','newly','day','when','there','need','prohibit','acute','aha','acc','recommendations','alpha','blockade','beta','use','alone','may','mask','hypoglycemic','prolonged','especially','while','formulation','infusions','mcg','infusion','verify','actual','vial','bag','infer','drug','name','substitute','oral','extended-release','formulations','products'],2,true)
